// Dream Sequence Part 3a: The Strait — First Watch (PRELUDE)
// Failed prologue mission. Kell commands one lance of 4 drones; allied
// operators run the other 16 and fly them straight into Iranian fire.
// Convoy never sails. The trauma sets up Kell taking direct control in
// the full Strait mission that follows.
// Map mirrors dream_strait.ron exactly (300x60). Duplication is pragmatic
// — there is no shared-map mechanism in MissionMap yet.
