    briefing_text: "First watch on the Hormuz desk. Convoy CO wants the strait scouted before the tankers transit. Twenty drones up, four operators on the boards.\n\nYou run Lance Alpha — four birds. Lieutenants Park, Ortiz, and Vance run Bravo, Charlie, Delta. They\'ve done the school. They\'ll be fine.\n\n\"Patrol pattern. Don\'t take the bait.\"",
